    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d555">

                <pb facs="0831" n="705" sameAs="frus:frus1925v01/pg705"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.5045/205: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-09-09T17:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 9,
                                1925—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received September 9—11:46
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>385. My telegram number 379, September 4, 9 a.m. Interested colleagues accept
                    proposed terms of reference with following modifications: (1) in paragraph (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">c</hi>) “do hereby authorize” changed to “do hereby
                    request”; (2) in paragraph (<hi rendition="#italic">i</hi>) “authorization”
                    changed to “request”; (3) all interested representatives to sign at the end of
                    paragraph (<hi rendition="#italic">h</hi>), and American, British and Japanese
                    representatives to sign again at the end of paragraph [(<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >i</hi>)]</p>
                <p>Action awaits selection of American and Japanese judges.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
